{"id":"en_i-bought-the-deadliest-dragon-slave","title":"I Bought the Deadliest Dragon Slave","titleEn":"I Bought the Deadliest Dragon Slave","description":"Betrayed when the man she loved tore out her heart to save another woman, she awakens reborn at the very underground auction where her fate once turned. This time she leaves the crippled former Dragon King to her sister and instead purchases the silent black killing machine. For forty-nine days the fallen king kneels and begs for her heart's blood, but she gives him demon chicken blood instead. Her new dragon kills him in the arena, takes the throne, and becomes her feral, unhinged king, devoted only to worshipping her. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-bought-the-deadliest-dragon-slave/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/i-bought-the-deadliest-dragon-slave/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Fictional Dynasty","High Fantasy","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cj8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_i-bought-the-deadliest-dragon-slave_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cj8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-bought-the-deadliest-dragon-slave_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cj8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-bought-the-deadliest-dragon-slave_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d0cj8/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_i-bought-the-deadliest-dragon-slave_4","